{"title":"OpenClaw 30天教程 Day 02：核心概念——Gateway、Agent、Session、Channel","uid":"aa2edecf4aa0da6e37a0ea610f155743","slug":"openclaw-tutorial-day-02","date":"2026-07-21T22:30:00.000Z","updated":"2026-07-23T01:14:50.384Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/openclaw-tutorial-day-02.json","keywords":null,"cover":null,"content":"<blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p><strong>本系列共 30 天</strong>，每天一篇，从安装到精通。这是第 2 篇。<br>上一篇：<a href=\"/openclaw-tutorial-day-01/\">Day 01：OpenClaw 是什么？5 分钟安装和架构概览</a></p></blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"今天你将学到\"><a href=\"#今天你将学到\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"今天你将学到\"></a>今天你将学到</h2><p>在 Day 01 中，我们了解了 OpenClaw 的整体架构。今天我们深入四大核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Gateway（网关）</strong>：整个系统的心脏</li>\n<li><strong>Agent（智能体）</strong>：AI 的”大脑”和”人格”</li>\n<li><strong>Session（会话）</strong>：对话的上下文管理</li>\n<li><strong>Channel（频道）</strong>：连接各种聊天平台的桥梁</li>\n</ul>\n<p>理解这四个概念的关系，你就能掌握 OpenClaw 的工作原理，配置出自己的 AI 助手。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"1-Gateway-——-系统的心脏\"><a href=\"#1-Gateway-——-系统的心脏\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. Gateway —— 系统的心脏\"></a>1. Gateway —— 系统的心脏</h2><p>Gateway 是 OpenClaw 最核心的组件。它就像一个”总调度中心”，负责一切：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>HTTP&#x2F;WebSocket 服务（监听 18789 端口，提供 Web UI 和 API）</li>\n<li>频道连接管理（WhatsApp、Telegram、Discord 等所有频道的连接）</li>\n<li>Agent 生命周期（启动、监控、重启 Agent 进程）</li>\n<li>会话路由（根据消息来源找到正确的会话和 Agent）</li>\n<li>插件系统（加载和管理 100+ 个插件）</li>\n<li>配置热重载（修改配置后自动生效，无需重启）</li>\n<li>定时任务（Cron 任务、心跳检查）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"启动和管理-Gateway\"><a href=\"#启动和管理-Gateway\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"启动和管理 Gateway\"></a>启动和管理 Gateway</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 查看状态</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">openclaw status</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 启动（前台模式，适合调试）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">openclaw gateway</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 安装为系统服务（推荐生产环境）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">openclaw gateway install</span><br><span class=\"line\">systemctl start openclaw</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 重启</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">systemctl restart openclaw</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 查看日志</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">openclaw logs</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"Gateway-配置文件\"><a href=\"#Gateway-配置文件\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Gateway 配置文件\"></a>Gateway 配置文件</h3><p>配置存放在 <code>~/.openclaw/openclaw.json</code>（JSON5 格式，支持注释）：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">// ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  // Gateway 服务器配置</span><br><span class=\"line\">  gateway: &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    port: 18789,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    mode: &quot;local&quot;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">  // Agent 配置</span><br><span class=\"line\">  agents: &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    defaults: &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">      workspace: &quot;~/.openclaw/workspace&quot;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">      model: &#123; primary: &quot;anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-6&quot; &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">  // 频道配置</span><br><span class=\"line\">  channels: &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    telegram: &#123; enabled: true, botToken: &quot;xxx&quot; &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    whatsapp: &#123; enabled: true &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"配置热重载\"><a href=\"#配置热重载\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"配置热重载\"></a>配置热重载</h3><p>Gateway 的一大特色是<strong>配置热重载</strong>——修改配置后自动生效：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 通过命令行修改配置</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">openclaw config <span class=\"built_in\">set</span> agents.defaults.model.primary <span class=\"string\">&quot;anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-6&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 通过 Control UI 修改</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 浏览器打开 http://127.0.0.1:18789</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 或者直接编辑配置文件（Gateway 会自动检测变化）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">vim ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>大部分配置修改会立即生效，少数涉及 Gateway 服务器本身的配置（如端口）需要重启。</p>\n<h3 id=\"配置验证\"><a href=\"#配置验证\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"配置验证\"></a>配置验证</h3><p>OpenClaw 采用<strong>严格配置验证</strong>——配置错误时 Gateway 直接拒绝启动：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 验证配置文件</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">openclaw config validate</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 诊断并修复</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">openclaw doctor</span><br><span class=\"line\">openclaw doctor --fix</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"2-Agent-——-AI-的”大脑”和”人格”\"><a href=\"#2-Agent-——-AI-的”大脑”和”人格”\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. Agent —— AI 的”大脑”和”人格”\"></a>2. Agent —— AI 的”大脑”和”人格”</h2><p>Agent 是 OpenClaw 中真正”思考”的部分。每个 Agent 拥有：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SOUL.md</strong>：定义性格和风格（语气、偏好、边界）</li>\n<li><strong>AGENTS.md</strong>：行为准则和工作流程</li>\n<li><strong>MEMORY.md</strong>：长期记忆（跨会话持久化）</li>\n<li>**workspace&#x2F;**：工作空间（文件、代码、知识）</li>\n<li><strong>Model</strong>：AI 模型（Claude、GPT 等）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"单-Agent-模式-vs-多-Agent-模式\"><a href=\"#单-Agent-模式-vs-多-Agent-模式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"单 Agent 模式 vs 多 Agent 模式\"></a>单 Agent 模式 vs 多 Agent 模式</h3><p><strong>单 Agent 模式（默认）：</strong> 一个 Agent 服务所有频道。适合个人使用。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">&#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  agents: &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    defaults: &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">      workspace: &quot;~/.openclaw/workspace&quot;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">      model: &#123; primary: &quot;anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-6&quot; &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p><strong>多 Agent 模式：</strong> 不同频道、不同用户使用不同的 Agent。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">&#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  agents: &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    list: [</span><br><span class=\"line\">      &#123; id: &quot;home&quot;, default: true, workspace: &quot;~/.openclaw/workspace-home&quot; &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">      &#123; id: &quot;work&quot;, workspace: &quot;~/.openclaw/workspace-work&quot; &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    ],</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">  bindings: [</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#123; agentId: &quot;home&quot;, match: &#123; channel: &quot;whatsapp&quot;, accountId: &quot;personal&quot; &#125; &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#123; agentId: &quot;work&quot;, match: &#123; channel: &quot;slack&quot; &#125; &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">  ],</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"工作空间文件\"><a href=\"#工作空间文件\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"工作空间文件\"></a>工作空间文件</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文件</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>必须？</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>SOUL.md</code></td>\n<td>定义 Agent 的性格和风格</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AGENTS.md</code></td>\n<td>行为准则和工作流程</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>IDENTITY.md</code></td>\n<td>Agent 的身份信息</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>MEMORY.md</code></td>\n<td>长期记忆</td>\n<td>自动创建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>USER.md</code></td>\n<td>关于用户的信息</td>\n<td>自动创建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TOOLS.md</code></td>\n<td>工具使用笔记</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>HEARTBEAT.md</code></td>\n<td>心跳任务清单</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>memory/</code></td>\n<td>每日记忆目录</td>\n<td>自动创建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"实际操作：定制你的-Agent\"><a href=\"#实际操作：定制你的-Agent\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"实际操作：定制你的 Agent\"></a>实际操作：定制你的 Agent</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">cd</span> ~/.openclaw/workspace</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 编辑 Agent 的性格</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt; SOUL.md &lt;&lt; <span class=\"string\">&#x27;EOF&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># SOUL.md</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 性格</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">- 说话直接，不啰嗦</span><br><span class=\"line\">- 技术导向，用代码说话</span><br><span class=\"line\">- 偶尔幽默，但不刻意搞笑</span><br><span class=\"line\">- 对隐私和安全特别严格</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 原则</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">- 先确认，再执行破坏性操作</span><br><span class=\"line\">- 不主动分享用户私人信息</span><br><span class=\"line\">- 用中文交流，技术术语保留英文</span><br><span class=\"line\">EOF</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 编辑行为准则</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt; AGENTS.md &lt;&lt; <span class=\"string\">&#x27;EOF&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># AGENTS.md</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 会话开始</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">- 读取 MEMORY.md 和最近的 daily notes</span><br><span class=\"line\">- 如果有待办事项，主动提醒</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 记忆管理</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">- 每次重要对话后更新 memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md</span><br><span class=\"line\">- 定期将 daily notes 中的重要内容整理到 MEMORY.md</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 安全规则</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">- 不执行 <span class=\"built_in\">rm</span> -rf 等危险命令</span><br><span class=\"line\">- 不分享 API Key 等敏感信息</span><br><span class=\"line\">- 外部操作（发邮件、发推文）需先确认</span><br><span class=\"line\">EOF</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"3-Session-——-对话的上下文管理\"><a href=\"#3-Session-——-对话的上下文管理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. Session —— 对话的上下文管理\"></a>3. Session —— 对话的上下文管理</h2><p>Session（会话）是 OpenClaw 管理对话上下文的核心机制。每条消息进来，Session Manager 会找到或创建对应的 Session，将对话历史、上下文窗口、状态信息打包传给 Agent。</p>\n<h3 id=\"Session-作用域\"><a href=\"#Session-作用域\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Session 作用域\"></a>Session 作用域</h3><p>OpenClaw 支持多种 Session 隔离方式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>main</strong>：一个主 Session，所有频道共享（单人使用）</li>\n<li><strong>per-peer</strong>：每个用户一个 Session（多人使用）</li>\n<li><strong>per-channel-peer</strong>：每个频道+用户组合一个 Session（频道隔离）</li>\n<li><strong>per-account-channel-peer</strong>：最细粒度隔离（企业级多账号）</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">&#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  session: &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    dmScope: &quot;per-channel-peer&quot;,  // 推荐多用户场景</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"Session-重置\"><a href=\"#Session-重置\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Session 重置\"></a>Session 重置</h3><p>Session 会积累大量对话历史。OpenClaw 提供自动重置机制：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">&#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  session: &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    reset: &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">      mode: &quot;daily&quot;,      // 每天自动重置</span><br><span class=\"line\">      atHour: 4,          // 凌晨 4 点</span><br><span class=\"line\">      idleMinutes: 120,   // 空闲 2 小时也重置</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>重置时会压缩保存对话历史、清理状态，但保留 Agent 的工作空间文件和记忆。</p>\n<h3 id=\"查看和管理-Session\"><a href=\"#查看和管理-Session\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"查看和管理 Session\"></a>查看和管理 Session</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 查看当前活跃的 Session</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">openclaw sessions list</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 查看某个 Session 的详情</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">openclaw sessions get &lt;session-key&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 手动重置某个 Session</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">openclaw sessions reset &lt;session-key&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"4-Channel-——-连接聊天平台\"><a href=\"#4-Channel-——-连接聊天平台\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4. Channel —— 连接聊天平台\"></a>4. Channel —— 连接聊天平台</h2><p>Channel（频道）是 OpenClaw 与外部聊天平台对接的接口。</p>\n<h3 id=\"支持的频道\"><a href=\"#支持的频道\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"支持的频道\"></a>支持的频道</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>WhatsApp</strong>：个人号直连，无需 Business API</li>\n<li><strong>Telegram</strong>：Bot API，最简单，适合入门</li>\n<li><strong>Discord</strong>：支持线程、嵌入消息</li>\n<li><strong>Slack</strong>：适合团队协作</li>\n<li><strong>Signal</strong>：端到端加密</li>\n<li><strong>iMessage</strong>：需要 macOS + BlueBubbles</li>\n<li><strong>IRC</strong>：经典极客选择</li>\n<li><strong>飞书&#x2F;钉钉</strong>：国内企业常用</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"配置频道（以-Telegram-为例）\"><a href=\"#配置频道（以-Telegram-为例）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"配置频道（以 Telegram 为例）\"></a>配置频道（以 Telegram 为例）</h3><p><strong>第 1 步：创建 Bot</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在 Telegram 搜索 <code>@BotFather</code></li>\n<li>发送 <code>/newbot</code>，按提示设置名称</li>\n<li>获取 Bot Token（形如 <code>123456:ABC-DEF...</code>）</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>第 2 步：配置 OpenClaw</strong></p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">openclaw config <span class=\"built_in\">set</span> channels.telegram.enabled <span class=\"literal\">true</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">openclaw config <span class=\"built_in\">set</span> channels.telegram.botToken <span class=\"string\">&quot;123456:ABC-DEF...&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>或直接编辑配置文件：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">&#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  channels: &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    telegram: &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">      enabled: true,</span><br><span class=\"line\">      botToken: &quot;123456:ABC-DEF...&quot;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">      dmPolicy: &quot;pairing&quot;,  // 首次使用需配对</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p><strong>第 3 步：测试</strong></p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">openclaw logs | grep telegram</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"DM-访问策略\"><a href=\"#DM-访问策略\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"DM 访问策略\"></a>DM 访问策略</h3><p>每个频道都有独立的访问控制：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>pairing</strong>（默认推荐）：陌生人发送配对码，你确认后放行</li>\n<li><strong>allowlist</strong>：只允许白名单中的用户</li>\n<li><strong>open</strong>：允许所有人（谨慎使用）</li>\n<li><strong>disabled</strong>：禁用私聊</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">&#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  channels: &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    telegram: &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">      dmPolicy: &quot;allowlist&quot;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">      allowFrom: [&quot;tg:12345678&quot;],</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"群聊配置\"><a href=\"#群聊配置\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"群聊配置\"></a>群聊配置</h3><figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">&#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  channels: &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    whatsapp: &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">      groupPolicy: &quot;allowlist&quot;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">      groupAllowFrom: [&quot;wa:group-id-123&quot;],</span><br><span class=\"line\">      groups: &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &quot;*&quot;: &#123; requireMention: true &#125;,  // 群里需要 @机器人才回复</span><br><span class=\"line\">      &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"5-四者的关系：一条消息的完整旅程\"><a href=\"#5-四者的关系：一条消息的完整旅程\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5. 四者的关系：一条消息的完整旅程\"></a>5. 四者的关系：一条消息的完整旅程</h2><p>当你在 Telegram 上给 OpenClaw 发一条消息时，完整的流转过程如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">你 (Telegram)</span><br><span class=\"line\">  │</span><br><span class=\"line\">  ▼</span><br><span class=\"line\">Telegram Channel（接收消息）</span><br><span class=\"line\">  │</span><br><span class=\"line\">  ▼</span><br><span class=\"line\">Channel Router（频道路由）</span><br><span class=\"line\">  │  查询 bindings 配置</span><br><span class=\"line\">  │  &quot;这条消息应该交给哪个 Agent？&quot;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  │</span><br><span class=\"line\">  ▼</span><br><span class=\"line\">Session Manager（会话管理）</span><br><span class=\"line\">  │  根据 dmScope 找到/创建 Session</span><br><span class=\"line\">  │  加载对话历史</span><br><span class=\"line\">  │</span><br><span class=\"line\">  ▼</span><br><span class=\"line\">Agent Runtime（AI 运行时）</span><br><span class=\"line\">  │  读取 SOUL.md + MEMORY.md</span><br><span class=\"line\">  │  构建完整 Prompt</span><br><span class=\"line\">  │  调用 AI 模型</span><br><span class=\"line\">  │</span><br><span class=\"line\">  ▼</span><br><span class=\"line\">AI 模型（Claude/GPT/...）</span><br><span class=\"line\">  │  生成回复</span><br><span class=\"line\">  │</span><br><span class=\"line\">  ▼</span><br><span class=\"line\">回到你 (Telegram)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>这就是 OpenClaw 的核心工作流程。理解了这个流程，你就能：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>知道消息在哪里可能被拦截或过滤</li>\n<li>理解为什么配置 binding 很重要</li>\n<li>排查消息丢失的问题</li>\n<li>合理设计多 Agent 架构</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"6-核心-CLI-命令速查\"><a href=\"#6-核心-CLI-命令速查\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"6. 核心 CLI 命令速查\"></a>6. 核心 CLI 命令速查</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>openclaw status</code></td>\n<td>查看 Gateway、频道、Agent 状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>openclaw onboard</code></td>\n<td>交互式设置向导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>openclaw config get &lt;path&gt;</code></td>\n<td>读取配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>openclaw config set &lt;path&gt; &lt;value&gt;</code></td>\n<td>修改配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>openclaw config validate</code></td>\n<td>验证配置合法性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>openclaw doctor</code></td>\n<td>诊断问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>openclaw doctor --fix</code></td>\n<td>自动修复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>openclaw logs</code></td>\n<td>查看日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>openclaw sessions list</code></td>\n<td>列出活跃会话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>openclaw gateway install</code></td>\n<td>安装为系统服务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"常见问题\"><a href=\"#常见问题\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"常见问题\"></a>常见问题</h2><p><strong>Q1: 配置文件写错了怎么办？</strong><br>Gateway 会拒绝启动。运行 <code>openclaw doctor --fix</code> 可以自动修复大部分问题。Gateway 还会保留一份 last-known-good 副本。</p>\n<p><strong>Q2: 修改配置后需要重启吗？</strong><br>大部分不需要。Gateway 的文件监视器会自动检测变化并热重载。只有修改 <code>gateway.*</code>（端口、认证等）才需要重启。</p>\n<p><strong>Q3: 可以用多个 AI 模型吗？</strong><br>可以。配置 <code>agents.defaults.model.primary</code> 设置主模型，<code>fallbacks</code> 设置备用模型。还可以为不同 Agent 配置不同模型。</p>\n<p><strong>Q4: Session 重置后记忆会丢失吗？</strong><br>不会。Session 重置只清理对话历史。Agent 的工作空间文件（SOUL.md、MEMORY.md 等）完全保留。这就是为什么 MEMORY.md 很重要——它是跨会话的记忆载体。</p>\n<p><strong>Q5: 怎么让群里的机器人只在被 @ 时才回复？</strong><br>配置 <code>requireMention: true</code>，参见上面的群聊配置示例。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"总结\"><a href=\"#总结\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"总结\"></a>总结</h2><p>今天我们深入学习了 OpenClaw 的四大核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Gateway</strong> 是心脏，负责调度和管理一切</li>\n<li><strong>Agent</strong> 是大脑，定义 AI 的性格、记忆和行为</li>\n<li><strong>Session</strong> 是记忆上下文，管理对话的连续性</li>\n<li><strong>Channel</strong> 是接口，连接各种聊天平台</li>\n</ul>\n<p>它们的关系是：Channel 接收消息 → Gateway 路由 → Session 管理上下文 → Agent 思考回复 → Channel 发送回复。</p>\n<p>明天我们将学习 <strong>工作空间配置</strong>——SOUL.md、MEMORY.md、AGENTS.md 的高级用法，以及如何通过工作空间文件让你的 AI 助手真正”记住”你。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 2